#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0252-D expect=skipped domain=ADAE
#note "SAME five wildcard families as the violation fixture, so NoMatch cannot be the cause of the skip. These variables are LEGITIMATE in an occurrence dataset, and the declared structure=OCCDS beats the columns (Fix #154, carried by the mandatory #library line), so the pre-gate finds the dataset outside Data_Structures: [BASIC DATA STRUCTURE, MEDICAL DEVICE BASIC DATA STRUCTURE] and the rule never runs. This is the whole point of the AD0252 A/B/C/D split - the prohibition is structure-specific - and it is the second of the batch's two pins on that Scope block (the other is on PMDA-AD0223)."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADAE structure=OCCDS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col AEDECOD  type=Char
col AOCC01FL type=Char
col TRTEM1FL type=Char
col TREM01FL type=Char
col ACAT1    type=Char
col LBORG1   type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | HEADACHE | Y | Y | Y | CAT1 | ORGA
